## 4. Fonts and Typography
Kazeshini relies on native system monospace font stacks (`ui-monospace`, `JetBrains Mono`, `SF Mono`, `Menlo`, `Consolas`, `Noto Sans Mono CJK JP`) and renders zero external CDN or downloaded web fonts, complying with SIL Open Font License (OFL) attribution standards where applicable.

